    "description": "<section id=\"knights-offerings\">\n  <h1>⚔️ Knights – CLAT 2028 Batch Offerings</h1>\n  <p><em>“Train Like a Knight. Rise Like a Legend.”</em></p>\n\n  <h2>📖 Academics & Live Learning</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Current Affairs LIVE Classes:</strong> Weekly sessions decoding national & international news, editorials, and government schemes in a CLAT-centric format.</li>\n    <li><strong>Legal Reasoning LIVE Classes:</strong> Real judgments, legal news, and passage-based learning to build legal reasoning mastery.</li>\n    <li><strong>English Language LIVE Classes:</strong> RC drills, grammar clarity, vocabulary, and tone analysis for English section mastery.</li>\n    <li><strong>Monthly – Lok Adaalats:</strong> Open mentorship forum with Prakhar Sir for doubt-solving, motivation & strategy refinement.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>🧑‍🏫 Self-Paced Masterclasses</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Quantitative Aptitude – Recorded Series:</strong> Shortcut-driven concept clarity for DI, arithmetic, and speed maths.</li>\n    <li><strong>Analytical Reasoning – Recorded Series:</strong> Puzzles, arrangements, number series, and logical exercises.</li>\n    <li><strong>Critical Reasoning – Recorded Series:</strong> Arguments, assumptions, flaws, and inferences taught via concept-based videos.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>📚 Learning Resources & Study Material</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>GK Elixir – Monthly Current Affairs Magazine:</strong> Curated with MPQs, editorial summaries, issue breakdowns and visual notes.</li>\n    <li><strong>Infinity Digest – Static GK eBook (3-Part Series):</strong> Covers Polity, History, Geography, Environment and more with charts & mind maps.</li>\n    <li><strong>Justice Times – Monthly Legal Affairs Magazine:</strong> All recent judgments, law reforms and legal news covered monthly.</li>\n    <li><strong>Toppers’ Handwritten Notes (Editorial-Based):</strong> Mind-mapped editorial summaries crafted by past top scorers.</li>\n    <li><strong>Theory Modules – Legal:</strong> Legal maxims, principles and CLAT-specific topics with examples.</li>\n    <li><strong>Theory Modules – English:</strong> Covers RC, tone, figures of speech, grammar and comprehension strategies.</li>\n    <li><strong>Theory Modules – Critical Reasoning:</strong> Deep conceptual explanations with CR practice drills.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>🧪 Practice & Evaluation</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>70 Full-Length Mock Tests:</strong> Simulated exams for CLAT, AILET, SLAT & MHCET with analysis reports.</li>\n    <li><strong>100 Sectional Tests – Subject-wise:</strong> Legal, GK, English, Quant & CR based tests for targeted practice.</li>\n    <li><strong>Monthly GK & Legal LIVE Quiz Battles:</strong> Fast-paced, competitive quizzes with leaderboards and peer benchmarking.</li>\n    <li><strong>VVIT List – Very Very Important Topics:</strong> Trend-based curated list of high-yield topics updated quarterly.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h2>🧭 Mentorship & Strategic Support</h2>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Personal Mentorship by Prakhar Sir:</strong> One-to-one strategy, goal-setting and accountability mentorship from the founder himself.</li>\n    <li><strong>Dedicated WhatsApp Groups (24x7 Mentor Access):</strong> Constant support through private Knight-only communities.</li>\n    <li><strong>GKI Magic Box:</strong> Access to ebooks, worksheets, application sets, PDFs and mind map resources.</li>\n    <li><strong>Knight’s Monthly Roadmap PDF:</strong> Monthly goal planner with revision topics, mocks, and priority zones.</li>\n  </ul>\n</section>\n",
