    "title": "GK Alpha - 2027 (Current Affairs, Static GK, Legal CA)",
    "description": "<section style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #160021, #2b0040); color: #ffffff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 18px; max-width: 900px; margin: auto;\">\n\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 35px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #ffd36a; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\n      GK Alpha 2027\n    </h1>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: normal; color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0;\">\n      6 Month Intensive Current Affairs & Static GK Batch for CLAT 2027\n    </h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #d8c6e8; max-width: 720px; margin: 18px auto 0;\">\n      A structured, rank-focused GK system designed for aspirants who want clarity, consistency, revision, and exam-oriented preparation for CLAT & AILET.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 28px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 211, 106, 0.35);\">\n\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 28px; color: #ffd36a; text-align: center; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 25px;\">\n      What You Get Inside GK Alpha\n    </h3>\n\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px;\">\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">01. LIVE Current Affairs Classes</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">Two live classes every week to cover the most relevant current affairs in a structured and exam-oriented manner.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">02. LIVE Static GK Classes</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">Conceptual and topic-wise Static GK coverage to strengthen the foundation required for CLAT, AILET and other law entrance exams.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">03. LIVE Legal Current Affairs Classes</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">Special legal current affairs sessions focused on judgments, bills, constitutional developments and legal events relevant for law aspirants.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">04. CLAT Elixir Monthly Premium CA Magazine</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">A monthly premium current affairs magazine curated specially for CLAT aspirants with important news, static links and exam-focused notes.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">05. 30 CA & Static GK Sectional Tests</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">Thirty printable sectional PDFs based on CLAT and AILET patterns to help students test, revise and improve consistently.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">06. 5 Full Length GKI Premium Mocks</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">Full length mock tests to help students experience real exam pressure, analyse performance and identify weak areas.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">07. LIVE Current Affairs Quizzes</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">Interactive live quizzes designed for active recall, faster revision and better retention of important current affairs.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">08. Monthly Elixir Discussion Sessions</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">Dedicated monthly sessions to revise and discuss the CLAT Elixir magazine so that students do not just read, but actually retain.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">09. MIT List: Most Important Topics</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">A live sheet updated weekly with the most important topics that students must track for CLAT and AILET preparation.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"padding: 16px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-left: 5px solid #ffd36a; border-radius: 10px;\">\n        <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 20px; color: #ffffff;\">10. VVIT List: Very Very Important Topics</h4>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0; color: #d8c6e8; font-size: 16px;\">A powerful Jan to Nov compilation of the most crucial topics for last-stage revision and final exam preparation.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 35px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"font-size: 26px; color: #ffd36a; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\n      Built for Serious CLAT 2027 Aspirants\n    </h3>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 17px; color: #d8c6e8; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n      GK Alpha is not just about covering current affairs. It is about creating a complete revision, testing and topic tracking system so that GK becomes your scoring advantage.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n</section>",
