    "lastUpdated": "2025-04-27T19:54:28.085Z",
    "content": "<body>\n    <h1>Privacy Policy for GK Infinity</h1>\n    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 1st May 2025</p>\n\n    <h2>Introduction</h2>\n    <p>Welcome to GK Infinity. We value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy outlines how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your data when you visit our website (<a href=\"https://gkinfinity.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://gkinfinity.com/</a>) or use our services.</p>\n    <p>By accessing or using our website, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>\n\n    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>\n    <h3>1.1 Personal Information</h3>\n    <p>Name, email address, phone number, and other contact details when you register or contact us. Payment information when you make purchases.</p>\n\n    <h3>1.2 Non-Personal Information</h3>\n    <p>Browser type, device information, IP address, and browsing behavior. Cookies and usage data to improve website functionality.</p>\n\n    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Provide and improve our services.</li>\n        <li>Process transactions and send confirmations.</li>\n        <li>Respond to your inquiries and provide customer support.</li>\n        <li>Personalize your experience and deliver targeted content.</li>\n        <li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>3. Sharing Your Information</h2>\n    <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. We may share your information with third parties in the following cases:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> To vendors who assist in operating our website and services.</li>\n        <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law or to protect our rights.</li>\n        <li><strong>Business Transfers:</strong> In case of a merger, sale, or acquisition.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>4. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>\n    <p>We use cookies and similar technologies to enhance your experience. These may include:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> For website functionality.</li>\n        <li><strong>Analytical Cookies:</strong> To understand user behavior and improve our services.</li>\n        <li><strong>Advertising Cookies:</strong> To deliver relevant ads.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>You can manage your cookie preferences through your browser settings.</p>\n\n    <h2>5. Data Security</h2>\n    <p>We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your data. However, no system is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>\n\n    <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>\n    <p>Depending on your location, you may have the following rights:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Access, correct, or delete your personal information.</li>\n        <li>Restrict or object to data processing.</li>\n        <li>Withdraw consent at any time.</li>\n        <li>Lodge a complaint with a data protection authority.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href=\"mailto:info.gkinfinity@gmail.com\">info.gkinfinity@gmail.com</a>.</p>\n\n    <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>\n    <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices. Please review their policies before sharing any information.</p>\n\n    <h2>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>\n    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date. Please review it periodically.</p>\n\n    <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>\n    <p>If you have questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>\n    <p><strong>GK Infinity</strong><br>\n       Email: <a href=\"mailto:info.gkinfinity@gmail.com\">info.gkinfinity@gmail.com</a><br>\n       Phone: 9425921109<br>\n       Address: S1, Narayan Nagar, Hoshangabad Road, Bhopal\n    </p>\n\n    <p>Thank you for trusting GK Infinity with your personal information. Your privacy is important to us.</p>\n</body>\n",
