    "isPublished": true,
    "content": "<body>\n    <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>\n    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 1st May 2025</p>\n\n    <p>Welcome to GK Infinity! By accessing or using our website and services, you agree to comply with these Terms and Conditions. Please read them carefully before proceeding. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must refrain from using our platform.</p>\n\n    <h2>1. Definitions</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Company</strong>, <strong>We</strong>, or <strong>Us</strong>: Refers to GK Infinity, its affiliates, and team.</li>\n        <li><strong>User</strong>, <strong>You</strong>, or <strong>Your</strong>: Refers to any individual or entity accessing or using our services.</li>\n        <li><strong>Services</strong>: Refers to all products, courses, tools, and resources provided by GK Infinity.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>2. Acceptance of Terms</h2>\n    <p>By accessing our website or using our services, you confirm that:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>You are at least 18 years old or have a guardian.</li>\n        <li>You have the legal authority to enter into this agreement on behalf of yourself or the entity you represent.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>3. Use of Services</h2>\n    <h3>a. Permitted Use</h3>\n    <p>You agree to use our services:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>In compliance with applicable laws and regulations.</li>\n        <li>For lawful and authorized purposes.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>b. Prohibited Use</h3>\n    <p>You must not:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Engage in unauthorized access or interfere with the platform's functionality.</li>\n        <li>Use the platform to transmit harmful, defamatory, or illegal content.</li>\n        <li>Reverse engineer, copy, or resell any part of the services.</li>\n        <li>Share any kind of credentials with any third party.</li>\n        <li>Defame GK Infinity on any social media platform.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>4. User Accounts</h2>\n    <h3>a. Account Creation</h3>\n    <p>To access certain features, you may need to create an account. You are responsible for:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Providing accurate and complete information.</li>\n        <li>Maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3>b. Account Termination</h3>\n    <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account for any violation of these terms.</p>\n\n    <h2>5. Payments and Refunds</h2>\n    <h3>a. Pricing</h3>\n    <p>All prices for services are listed on the website and are subject to change without notice.</p>\n\n    <h3>b. Payments</h3>\n    <p>Payment for services must be made through authorized methods. Failure to complete payment may result in restricted access.</p>\n\n    <h3>c. Refund Policy</h3>\n    <p>Refunds are governed by our Refund Policy. Please review it for detailed terms.</p>\n\n    <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>\n    <p>All content, including but not limited to text, graphics, logos, and software, is the exclusive property of GK Infinity and protected by intellectual property laws. You must not use, reproduce, or distribute this content without prior written permission.</p>\n\n    <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n    <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, GK Infinity shall not be liable for:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of our services.</li>\n        <li>Loss of data, revenue, or profit due to interruptions or errors.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>8. Indemnification</h2>\n    <p>You agree to indemnify and hold GK Infinity harmless from any claims, damages, liabilities, or expenses arising from your use of the services or breach of these terms.</p>\n\n    <h2>9. Third-Party Links</h2>\n    <p>Our website may include links to third-party websites. We do not control or endorse these sites and are not responsible for their content or policies. Use them at your own risk.</p>\n\n    <h2>10. Privacy</h2>\n    <p>Your use of the platform is also governed by our <a href=\"https://gkinfinity.com/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\">Privacy Policy</a>. By using our services, you consent to the practices described in the Privacy Policy.</p>\n\n    <h2>11. Changes to Terms</h2>\n    <p>We reserve the right to update or modify these terms at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with the updated effective date. Continued use of the services indicates your acceptance of the revised terms.</p>\n\n    <h2>12. Governing Law</h2>\n    <p>These Terms and Conditions shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Bhopal, Madhya Pradesh. Any disputes will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in India.</p>\n\n    <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>\n    <p>If you have any questions or concerns regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at:</p>\n    <p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info.gkinfinity@gmail.com\">info.gkinfinity@gmail.com</a></p>\n</body>\n",
