    "title": "GKI - Refunds and Cancellations Policy",
    "content": "<body>\n    <h1>Refund and Cancellation Policy</h1>\n    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> 1st May 2025</p>\n\n    <p>At GK Infinity, we are committed to delivering high-quality services and resources to our users. Please carefully review our Refund and Cancellation Policy before purchasing or subscribing to our services.</p>\n\n    <h2>1. No Cancellations</h2>\n    <p>Once a service is purchased or a subscription is activated, cancellations are not permitted under any circumstances. We encourage users to review all service details and make informed decisions before proceeding with a purchase.</p>\n\n    <h2>2. No Refunds</h2>\n    <p>All purchases made on GK Infinity are final. We do not offer refunds for:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Digital products or course materials.</li>\n        <li>Subscriptions, memberships, or one-time services.</li>\n        <li>Failed user participation or incomplete usage of purchased services.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>This policy applies regardless of circumstances, including but not limited to:</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Change of mind.</li>\n        <li>Inability to use the service.</li>\n        <li>Technical issues beyond our control.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>3. Exceptional Circumstances</h2>\n    <p>In the rare event that a service is unavailable due to errors on our part, we may review the situation and provide a resolution at our sole discretion. However, this does not guarantee any refund or cancellation.</p>\n\n    <h2>4. Contact Us</h2>\n    <p>If you have questions about this policy or require assistance with our services, please contact us:</p>\n    <p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:info.gkinfinity@gmail.com\">info.gkinfinity@gmail.com</a></p>\n\n    <p>This Refund and Cancellation Policy is designed to ensure clarity and consistency. By using our services, you acknowledge and agree to these terms. Thank you for understanding and supporting GK Infinity.</p>\n</body>\n",
